}, {
"LINES": [" What now? "],
"WHO": "Edward "
}, {
"LINES": [" We snagged those crates you asked for but errr... ", " They're filled with plushes! "],
"WHO": "Paul "
}, {
"LINES": [" So? You shall get your payment once I get my limited edition plushes. "],
"WHO": "Edward "
}, {
"LINES": [" You can't seriously be collecting plushies in your 40s man. ", " There are only 3 plush factories left in the world... ", " How did you even know that this crate was in Cloud City? "],
"WHO": "Paul "
}, {
"LINES": [" I have my methods. ", " Regardless, I want that crate delivered to my home at 12th Kekato Street without much delay. ", " Do not contact me again unless you have delivered the crates."],
